      "text": [
        " كَتَبْتُ إِلَى أَبِي الْحَسَنِ ( عليه السلام ) أَسْأَلُهُ عَنِ الْفُقَّاعِ قَالَ فَكَتَبَ يَقُولُ هُوَ الْخَمْرُ وَ فِيهِ حَدُّ شَارِبِ الْخَمْرِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Fazzal who said, ",
          "‘I wrote to Abu Al-Hassan<sup>asws</sup> asking him<sup>asws</sup> about the fermented drink. So he<sup>asws</sup> wrote: ‘It is the wine and regarding it is a legal penalty (<span class=\"iTxt\">Hadd</span>) of the wine drinker’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "15. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn Faddal who has said the following: “I once wrote to abu al-Hassan and asked about al-Fuqa’. He (the Imam) said in writing, ‘It is wine and the penalty for drinking it is like that for drinking wine.’” "
        ]
      }
